    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn Estate Agents are delighted to present 101 Stapolin Lawns to the sales market. A large light filled 4 bedroomed semi-detached family home which has been extended to side and rear with accommodation extending to c. 150sq,m. Downstairs the property has 2 reception rooms, bedroom with whb & wc, open plan kitchen/dining room, sunroom and is further complimented by a cobblelock driveway to front offering off street parking. Upstairs are 3 bedrooms, 1 ensuite and family bathroom. Stapolin Lawns is a very popular residential enclave and will have appeal to first time buyers or people looking to trade up in the area. Viewing highly recommended. \n\nSituated in Baldoyle the property is easily accessible from the Coast/Grange Road`s and the M50 motorway. There are an excellent choice of amenities to offer, choice of local shops, supermarkets Lidl, Supervalu, Donaghmede Shopping Centre, coffee shops, restaurants, Father Collins Park, sports clubs, playgrounds and a choice of schools/child care facilities. The property is within walking distance of Bayside/Clongriffin DART station`s, bus links and walking distance to Baldoyle sea front/beach. The property is also easily accessible for Portmarnock Beach, Port Tunnel, M50/M1 motorway`s and Dublin International Airport."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch Entrance - 1.72m (5'8\") x 0.77m (2'6\")\nTiled floor.\n\nReception Hall\nUnderstairs storage. Tiled floor.\n\nLounge - 3.85m (12'8\") x 3m (9'10\")\nMarble fireplace with timber surround. Gas fire inset. Semi solid oak flooring.\n\nFamily Room - 5.29m (17'4\") x 3.11m (10'2\")\nSemi solid oak flooring.\n\nKitchen - 3.93m (12'11\") x 2.52m (8'3\")\nRange of shaker fitted press units. Tiled behind worktop. Plumbed for washing machine. Tiled floor.\n\nDining Room - 5.19m (17'0\") x 2.35m (7'9\")\nRange of shaker fitted press units. Tiled floor. Recessed lighting. Sliding door to:-\n\nSunroom - 6.17m (20'3\") x 2.58m (8'6\")\nAluminium double glazed. Tiled floor.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.42m (11'3\") x 2.37m (7'9\")\nStorage closet. Laminate flooring. Whb and wc, fully tiled.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.73m (12'3\") x 3.59m (11'9\")\nBuilt in wardrobes. Laminate flooring. Ensuite: Shower, whb and wc. Fully tiled floor & walls.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.39m (11'1\") x 3.08m (10'1\")\nSliderobes. Laminate flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.59m (8'6\") x 2.46m (8'1\")\nBuilt in wardrobes. Laminate flooring.\n\nBathroom - 3.19m (10'6\") x 2.28m (7'6\")\nJacuzzi bath, whb and wc. Separate shower tray, screen. Fully tiled floor & walls.\n\n"
      },
      {
